Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}玩截流的兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.94,0:00:02.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}我刚刚发现一个特别
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.15,0:00:02.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}不要{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}脸的玩法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:05.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}像以前我们去截流都是找\N同行的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.49,0:00:06.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}看到同行评论
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}区有咨询的客户
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:09.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}就一个一个的去打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:10.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}现在已经是ai的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}很多老板全在用ai去跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:13.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}操作也非常简单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:14.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}把同行的链接放上去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:16.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}输入行业{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}关键{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:17.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}让ai去帮你找那些刚刚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:19.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}评论的客户就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:21.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}你只需要设置好打招呼的话术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.01,0:00:22.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}让ai去打招呼就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}玩截流的都知道找到客户的
